  Members are marked TEAM_LEADER_PROVIDED / pending Wharton roster
  confirmation instead of claiming official registration.
- Signature lookup requires an exact name or ID: no more auto-created
  "Student X" members and no prefix matches.
- Tests sign as real roster members instead of Student A/B.
- wharton_public_2026_27.yaml records what Wharton's public pages
  confirm (dates, team size, deliverables, AI policy, team leader age,
  advisor rules) and lists items only available in SMApply materials.

